'''Zoram'gar Outpost''' is a Horde outpost located on the [[Zoram Strand]] of [[Ashenvale]]. It is the very last attempt in gaining control over Ashenvale by the Horde without breaking the "truce". Zoram'gar is troll controlled. 

== Facilities ==
* Flight Master
* Fisherman
* Quests Givers

